 'LOC scan 36 is the controlling first-edition source surface for OYSTER SOUP; scan 37 begins BARLEY SOUP and therefore fixes the unit boundary. Exact-1824 TextGrid confirms the 1824 opening Put on two quarts of oysters, rather than the later-edition Wash and drain wording. No human visual or glyph-level adjudication is claimed.','system_recorded','high',
